//- LOCALS: activeApp, queue (NORMALIZED ROWS). WHOLE-LIST OOB SWAP DODGES THE
//- "ROW ID THAT DOESN'T EXIST YET" PROBLEM FOR NEW/FINISHED ITEMS; ROW IDS
//- STAY STABLE SO THE 0.5s WIDTH TRANSITION KEEPS BARS SMOOTH.
#appQueueList(
  hx-select-oob="#appQueueList"
  hx-swap-oob="outerHTML"
)
  - var rows = queue || []
  if rows.length
    each item in rows
      .request-row(id=`appq-${activeApp.id}-${item.id}`)
        .request-info
          .request-title= item.title
          .request-meta= item.status + (item.timeleft ? ` — ${item.timeleft} left` : '')
        .request-status
          .request-progress
            .request-progress-track
              .request-progress-bar(style=`width: ${item.percent}%`)
            .request-progress-text #{item.percent}%
  else
    .appQueueEmpty The queue is sleeping — nothing downloading right now.
